flowchart TB
    U["Authenticated user<br/>Telegram / trusted local entry / paired device"]
    A{"Verify caller and scope<br/>Local Python + private binding/enrollment"}
    D["Reject unknown caller<br/>No model access"]
    Q["Save request + attribution<br/>Private SQLite"]
    R{"Owner /report?"}
    F["Read saved Markdown board<br/>Local Python · no model"]
    P["Prepare attributed input<br/>Current message + relevant replied-to part<br/>Photos: native input · voice: readable native or on-device transcript"]
    C{"Same Chief Codex thread<br/>Current model + existing context + relevant tool reads<br/>Answer directly or choose an existing owner?"}
    O["Existing project owner<br/>Own model/context · repo · tools · useful specialists<br/>Implementation, checks and authorized release"]
    E["Outcome or necessary missing input<br/>Retain original sender authority"]
    B["Chief records task facts<br/>Same Markdown card + evidence + movement history<br/>Batched private Git recovery"]
    T["Scoped reply → private SQLite outbox<br/>Complete text split to fit Telegram messages"]
    S["Telegram API sends parts<br/>Local Python + network, no model"]
    V{"Delivery receipt verified?"}
    Y["Delivered to original recipient"]
    N["Keep uncertain state<br/>Do not blindly replay"]
    U --> A
    A -->|no| D
    A -->|yes| Q --> R
    R -->|yes| F --> T
    R -->|no| P --> C
    C -->|direct answer| B
    C -->|project task: one concise brief| O --> E --> B
    B --> T --> S --> V
    V -->|yes| Y
    V -->|no| N
